---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base current="event-space" title="Events at The Common | Squamish" description="Host a gathering, workshop, or community event at The Common in downtown Squamish. Tell us what you are planning.">
  <header class="page-hd"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow on-dark">Gather here</span><h1>Room for people<br />and good ideas.</h1><p>Looking for a place to bring a group together in downtown Squamish? Tell us what you have in mind.</p></div></header>
  <section class="section light"><div class="wrap split"><div><span class="kicker">The Common after the workday</span><h2>Make something happen here.</h2><p>The Common has hosted meetups, workshops, socials, and community gatherings. The shared room, kitchen, and courtyard give people room to talk, learn, and spend time together.</p><p>We plan larger gatherings with you directly so we can confirm the layout, timing, capacity, and any equipment you need. Tell us the date, group size, and what kind of event you are planning.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:welcome@thecommon.io?subject=Event%20at%20The%20Common">Ask about an event ↗</a></div><img class="photo" src="/img/approved/shared-table.jpg" alt="People gathered around a table at The Common" loading="lazy" /></div></section>
  <section class="section warm"><div class="wrap event-grid"><article><span class="kicker">Meeting with a smaller group?</span><h2>Book a room online.</h2><p>The Small Conference Room, Trailer, and Micro Office each have their own availability and booking page.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/spaces/">Explore bookable rooms ↗</a></article><article><span class="kicker">Community ideas</span><h2>Tell us your story.</h2><p>The Common has supported local groups and nonprofit gatherings. We can discuss what might be possible for your event.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/community/">Our community story ↗</a></article></div></section>
</Base>
<style>.split h2,.event-grid h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.5vw,3.2rem);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:.7rem 0 1rem}.split p,.event-grid p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.06rem}.split .btn{margin-top:.6rem}.event-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,5rem)}.event-grid article{border-top:2px solid var(--forest);padding-top:1.5rem}@media(max-width:700px){.event-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
